Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:37:20 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] DLSS5 options for the emulator's own neural rendering; Lemon
 FG is Multi FG

The emulator now runs DLSS5 on the game picture itself instead of through
Magpie: the group no longer names Magpie or asks for a window, Boost and
its resolution are gone, and the fine tuning starts at Standard with 1.5
tone, structure and skin. Lemon FG is shown as Multi FG.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
